{\H1.2x;\C3;1.00   \LGENERAL\l\C4;\P}1.01  ALL DIMENSIONS ARE IN SI UNITS. \P1.02  WORK TO FIGURED DIMENSIONS AND DO NOT SCALE THE DRAWING. \P1.03  ALL STRUCTURAL DRAWINGS SHALL BE READ IN CONJUNCTION WITH\P        RELEVANT ARCHITECTURAL AND SERVICE 
  3
DRAWINGS. \P1.04 DIMENSIONS AND CONDITIONS MUST BE VERIFIED IN THE SITE. AND ANY  \P        DISCRIPANCIES SHALL BE BROUGHT TO THE NOTICE OF THE CONSULTANT  \P        BEFORE PROCEEDING WITH THE AFFECTED PART OF THE  WORK.\P1.05  ALL LEVELS OF THE PROJ
  3
ECT REFERS TO ARCHITECTURAL DRAWING. \P1.06  THE STRUCTURE IS DESIGNED FOR : \P\pxi-3,l3,t3;{\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·^I}TOWER - 3 BASEMENTS+ BASEMENT 01/PODIUM+8 STILT+9TH FLOOR/PODIUM+54 FLOORS+SWIMMING POOL FLOOR +TERRACE (HEAD ROOM)+CANOPY FLOOR.\P{
  3
\fSymbol|b0|i0|c2|p18;·^I}NON TOWER AREA - 3 BASEMENTS+  BASEMENT 01/PODIUM+8 STILT+9TH FLOOR/PODIUM.\P\pi0,l0,tz;1.07 THE STRUCTURE IS DESIGNED TO BE SELF SUPPORTING AND STABLE AFTER THE  \P        BUILDING IS COMPLETE. IT IS THE CONTRACTORS RESPONSI
  3
BILITY TO ^I^IDETERMINE ERECTION PROCEDURES\P        AND SEQUENCE TO INSURE SAFETY OF THE BUILDING AND ITS COMPONENTS  \P        DURING ERECTION. THIS INCLUDES THE ADDITION OF NECESSARY SHORING, \P        SHEETING, TEMPORARY BRACING, OR TIE DOWNS.\P1.0
  1
8 PROPOSED CHANGES OR SUBSTITUTIONS TO STRUCTURAL DETAILS OR PLANS \P        SHALL BE SUBMITTED TO THE  CONSULTANT FOR REVIEW AND APPROVAL.\P\pa0.25; 
  7
