\pxi-3,l3;4.05   PROPER SHORT TERM / LONG TERM PRECAUTIONARY MEASURES INCLUDING SHORING, STRUTTING, BRACING  SHALL BE PROVIDED FOR EXCAVATION TO BASEMENT ADJOINING THE NEIGHBORING STRUCTURES TO HOLD EARTH WHERE REQUIRED 100 THICK BINDING AND 150 THIC
  3
K SOLING WITH SAND CUSHION SHALL BE  PROVIDED UNDER RAFT,INDEPENDENT AND COMBINED FOOTINGS IF REQUIRED DEWATERING SHALL BE DONE BY PROVIDING  SUMPS DEEPER THAN THE GENERAL EXCAVATION FOR RAFT BUT BEYOND THE BUILDING LINES.  \P\P\pi0,l0;4.06 REFER SEP
  3
ARATE GENERAL EXCAVATION DRAWING AND SOIL \P        CONSULTANT INPUTS FOR EARTH WORK.\P*4.07  ALL ABOVE MEASURES TO BE BROUGHT TO THE NOTICE OF SOIL \P           CONSULTANTS  FOR APPROVAL BEFORE EXECUTION.\P4.08   REFER SOIL REPORT BY “RECOMMENDATION
  3
 BY GEOTECH C{\A1;ONSULTANTS.\P}4.09   UNLESS OTHERWISE NOTED, 100 THK. PCC WITH CUBE STRENGTH OF \P          10 N/MM{\A1;2 SHALL BE PROVIDED ON ALL SOIL SURFACES FORMING THE  \P          BASE FOR STRUCTURAL CONCRETE MEMBERS.\P4.10   FOR EXCAVATION B
  1
ELOW GROUND WATER TABLE, WHEREVER SEEPAGES     \P          AS DEWATERING PUMPS      \P          SHALL BE PROVIDED TO KEEP THE EXCAVATION PIT ADEQUATELY DRY  \P          DURING FORMING AND CASTING THE FOUNDATION.}
